  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/gandhinagar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gandhinagar</a>: Chief minister <a href=\"/tag/bhupendra+patel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bhupendra Patel</a> on Sunday inaugurated the <a href=\"/tag/pb+patan+janata+cancer+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PB Patan Janata Cancer Hospital</a> in <a href=\"/tag/patan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Patan</a>, established by the <a href=\"/tag/jeevan+jyot+charitable+trust\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jeevan Jyot Charitable Trust</a>. According to an official statement, the hospital has been equipped with a Rs 22 crore <a href=\"/tag/linear+accelerator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">linear accelerator</a> for <a href=\"/tag/radiotherapy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">radiotherapy</a> treatment.Addressing the gathering, Patel said the facility will make specialised cancer care more accessible to patients in Patan and neighbouring regions. The statement added that the hospital will also provide <a href=\"/tag/pet+scan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PET scan</a> services, a facility that was previously unavailable in North <a href=\"/tag/gujarat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gujarat</a>.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>PET scans will be offered free of cost to <a href=\"/tag/ayushman+bharat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ayushman Bharat</a> cardholders, the statement said.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                  